    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "08. Command Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "08.05",
    "summary": "Rules set to trigger as the Command phase closes are resolved at this point. Rules other than mission rules come first. After that, both players consult their mission, and any aspects of it that one or both of them have achieved and that trigger now are resolved.",
